e browser\n- Native Performance - Built with OpenXR and native C++ rendering for smooth 72fps visuals\n\nHow to Use:\n1. Launch the app and grant camera permission\n2. Look at any QR code through the passthrough view\n3. The scanner automatically detects and decodes the code\n4. Use your right controller to interact with results\n5. Press Exit or B/Y to quit", "short_description": "Scan QR codes in mixed reality using your Quest 3 passthrough camera. Fast, accurate scanning with controller support."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://f1tt0n.github.io/qrscanner-privacy/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Anwar Studio Official", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://f1tt0n.github.io/qrscanner-privacy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34480285768283405"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "922689593733455"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "922689593733455"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774031220, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "922689593733455"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "35518861831092455", "version": "2.8"}, "id": "1615068473109791", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "34445410471770935", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35518861831092455"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1615068473109791"}]}, "change_log": "What's new in 2.8\n\nScanning\n\u2022 Major scan-quality boost \u2014 analysis runs on a small region around the reticle at full sensor resolution, so small and distant codes are picked up almost instantly\n\u2022 Scan area now correctly tracks the on-panel reticle (no more misaligned detection)\n\u2022 Joystick zoom resizes the scan area too \u2014 pull the panel closer for a larger zone, push it away for precision\n\u2022 Pulling the panel fully close switches to whole-FOV scanning for very large codes (posters, packaging)\n\nSmart actions\n\u2022 YouTube links open in YouTube VR (not Horizon Browser) when installed\n\u2022 Maps codes (geo:) fall back to Google Maps in browser when no native maps app is present\n\u2022 When no Quest app handles a scan, opens Meta Store with a search hint (e.g. \"search for 'maps'\")\n\u2022 Better support for tel:, smsto:, mailto:, vCard, calendar \u2014 proper package visibility for Android 11+\n\nUX\n\u2022 Scanner pauses cleanly when a 2D panel is in front (no more random beeps from the background)\n\u2022 Red overlay over the panel when the scanner is paused, so it's obvious why nothing is happening\n\u2022 Friendlier message after launching an external app \u2014 \"look around or press Meta button\" if not visible\n\u2022 Controls help on first launch highlights the joystick zoom in yellow\n\nStability\n\u2022 Several fixes around camera permission flow and lifecycle on relaunch", "created_date": 1778241992, "id": "35518861831092455", "version": "2.8", "version_code": 10, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "34445410471770935", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35518861831092455"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1615068473109791"}]}, "change_log": "What's new in 2.7\n\n\u2022 Precise aiming \u2014 only the code under the reticle is captured, even when multiple codes are visible in the camera view\n\u2022 Smaller, more focused reticle for easier targeting\n\u2022 Fewer accidental scans in dense scenes (walls of QR codes, menus, packaging)", "created_date": 1776190676, "id": "35006400582338585", "version": "2.7", "version_code": 9, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "34445410471770935", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35518861831092455"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1615068473109791"}]}, "change_log": "What's new in 2.6\n\n\u2022 Much better scan quality \u2014 higher-resolution camera analysis (1920\u00d71080 when available) and faster scan rate detect smaller and more distant QR codes\n\u2022 Relaxed aim requirement \u2014 you no longer need to perfectly center the code in the reticle\n\u2022 First-launch help \u2014 clear red banner over the reticle when camera access hasn't been granted, with one-trigger shortcut to app settings\n\u2022 Auto-resume after granting permission \u2014 no need to restart the app\n\u2022 Fix: Exit button now works correctly while the permission banner is visible", "created_date": 1776189693, "id": "35006166442361999", "version": "2.6", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "34445410471770935", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35518861831092455"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1615068473109791"}]}, "change_log": "What's new in 2.5\n\n\u2022 Wi-Fi auto-connect \u2014 scan a Wi-Fi QR and tap Connect to join instantly\n\u2022 Contact cards (vCard) \u2014 save scanned contacts to your address book\n\u2022 Calendar events \u2014 add scanned VEVENTs directly to your calendar\n\u2022 Smart actions for every type \u2014 Email, Phone, SMS, Maps, URL all open the right app with one tap\n\u2022 Audio + haptic feedback on each scan\n\u2022 Export scan history to CSV (Downloads folder)\n\u2022 Duplicate suppression \u2014 same code won't spam your history\n\u2022 Fix: cursor sometimes not appearing after relaunch\n\u2022 Improved error messages for camera / permission issues\n\u2022 Performance: eliminated per-frame allocations, modernized Camera2 API", "created_date": 1776187865, "id": "35005720369073273", "version": "2.5", "version_code": 7, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "34445410471770935", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35518861831092455"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1615068473109791"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1773835535, "id": "34455505457428103", "version": "2.4", "version_code": 6, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}